\pard\sa160\f0\fs32\b Mac Monitor \u8212? H\u432?\u7899?ng d\u7851?n c\u224?i \u273?\u7863?t\par
\pard\sa160\f0\fs22\b TI\u7870?NG VI\u7878?T\par
\pard\sa160\f0\fs22\b0 1. K\u233?o Mac Monitor v\u224?o th\u432? m\u7909?c Applications b\u234?n c\u7841?nh.\par
\pard\sa160\f0\fs22\b0 2. M\u7903? Mac Monitor t\u7915? Applications. Bi\u7875?u t\u432?\u7907?ng m\u224?n h\u236?nh s\u7869? xu\u7845?t hi\u7879?n tr\u234?n menu bar.\par
\pard\sa160\f0\fs22\b N\u7871?u macOS b\u225?o \u8220?Apple could not verify\u8230?\u8221? khi m\u7903? l\u7847?n \u273?\u7847?u:\par
\pard\sa160\f0\fs22\b0 \u8226? B\u7845?m Done \u273?\u7875? \u273?\u243?ng th\u244?ng b\u225?o.\par
\pard\sa160\f0\fs22\b0 \u8226? M\u7903? C\u224?i \u273?\u7863?t h\u7879? th\u7889?ng (System Settings) \u8594? Quy\u7873?n ri\u234?ng t\u432? & B\u7843?o m\u7853?t (Privacy & Security).\par
\pard\sa160\f0\fs22\b0 \u8226? K\u233?o xu\u7889?ng ph\u7847?n B\u7843?o m\u7853?t, t\u236?m Mac Monitor v\u224? b\u7845?m V\u7851?n m\u7903? (Open Anyway).\par
\pard\sa160\f0\fs22\b0 \u8226? X\u225?c nh\u7853?n b\u7857?ng Touch ID ho\u7863?c m\u7853?t kh\u7849?u Mac n\u7871?u \u273?\u432?\u7907?c h\u7887?i, r\u7891?i ch\u7885?n M\u7903? (Open).\par
\pard\sa160\f0\fs20\b0 Ch\u7881? th\u7921?c hi\u7879?n n\u7871?u b\u7841?n t\u7843?i app t\u7915? repository ch\u237?nh th\u7913?c b\u234?n d\u432?\u7899?i. B\u7843?n n\u224?y ch\u432?a \u273?\u432?\u7907?c Apple notarize. Kh\u244?ng c\u7847?n t\u7855?t Gatekeeper ho\u7863?c ch\u7841?y l\u7879?nh Terminal.\par
\pard\sa160\f0\fs20\b0 \u272?\u7875? d\u249?ng ph\u237?m t\u259?ng/gi\u7843?m s\u225?ng: cho ph\u233?p Mac Monitor trong C\u224?i \u273?\u7863?t h\u7879? th\u7889?ng \u8594? Quy\u7873?n ri\u234?ng t\u432? & B\u7843?o m\u7853?t \u8594? Tr\u7907? n\u259?ng (Accessibility). Thanh tr\u432?\u7907?t kh\u244?ng c\u7847?n quy\u7873?n n\u224?y.\par
\pard\sa160\f0\fs20\b0 \par
\pard\sa160\f0\fs24\b ENGLISH \u8212? INSTALLATION\par
\pard\sa160\f0\fs22\b0 1. Drag Mac Monitor into the Applications folder beside it.\par
\pard\sa160\f0\fs22\b0 2. Open Mac Monitor from Applications. Its display icon appears in your menu bar.\par
\pard\sa160\f0\fs22\b If macOS says \u8220?Apple could not verify\u8230?\u8221? on first launch:\par
\pard\sa160\f0\fs22\b0 \u8226? Click Done to dismiss the alert.\par
\pard\sa160\f0\fs22\b0 \u8226? Open System Settings \u8594? Privacy & Security.\par
\pard\sa160\f0\fs22\b0 \u8226? Scroll to Security, find Mac Monitor, and click Open Anyway.\par
\pard\sa160\f0\fs22\b0 \u8226? Authenticate with Touch ID or your Mac password if prompted, then click Open.\par
\pard\sa160\f0\fs20\b0 Only proceed if you downloaded the app from the official repository below. This release is not Apple notarized. You do not need to disable Gatekeeper or run Terminal commands.\par
\pard\sa160\f0\fs20\b0 For keyboard brightness controls, allow Mac Monitor in System Settings \u8594? Privacy & Security \u8594? Accessibility. Sliders work without this permission.\par
\pard\sa160\f0\fs20\b0 \par
